        "incidentKind": "Unplanned",
        "mainCategory": "ALPINE CONDITIONS",
        "lastUpdated": 1749069811312,
        "otherAdvice": "<p><strong>Seasonal road closures from Saturday 7 June:</strong></p><ul><li>Kosciuszko Road - Between Perisher and Charlotte Pass</li><li>Link Road - Between Smiggin holes and Guthega</li><li>Kings Cross Road - Between Cabramurra and Selwyn Resort</li><li>Tooma Road, and Snow Ridge Road between Khancoban and Cabramurra.</li></ul><p><strong>Chains must be carried in Kosciuszko National Park in winter (4WDs exempt). </strong></p><p>All motorists should be prepared and equipped for sudden changes in road and weather conditions in Alpine areas.</p>",
